{"name":"Powder Blush","hex":"#d8948b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"powder","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The fine particles which are the result of reducing a dry substance by pounding, grinding, or triturating, or the result of decay; dust.\n\n Cocaine in powder form (as opposed to crack).","Cocaine in powder form (as opposed to crack)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To reduce to fine particles; to pound, grind, or rub into a powder.","To sprinkle with powder, or as if with powder."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/powder"},{"term":"blush","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of blushing; a pink or red glow on the face caused by embarrassment, shame, shyness, love, etc.","A glow; a flush of colour, especially pink or red."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become red or pink in the face (and sometimes experience an associated feeling of warmth), especially due to shyness, love, shame, excitement, or embarrassment.","To be shy, ashamed, or embarrassed (to do something)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Rouge (cosmetics)","blocks":[{"text":"Rouge, also called blush or blusher, is a cosmetic for coloring the cheeks in a variety of shades, or the lips red. It is applied as a powder, cream or liquid."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Make-up_box_MAN_Paestum_T.4-1990.jpg/330px-Make-up_box_MAN_Paestum_T.4-1990.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rouge_(cosmetics)","wikidata":"Q181791"},{"title":"Powder","blocks":[{"text":"A powder is a dry solid composed of many very fine particles that may flow freely when shaken or tilted. Powders are a special sub-class of granular materials, although the terms powder and granular are sometimes used to distinguish separate classes of material. In particular, powders refer to those granular materials 